#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential Vault"
msgstr "Ivolthi Yobufakazi Bokungena"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Ifayela Lokhiye Wevolthi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored credentials. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write (the same applies to credential files); the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored credentials must be entered again."
msgstr "Indlela ephelele eya kukhiye ongu-32-byte obethela ubufakazi bokungena obugcinwe. Zenzele wona, ngaphandle kwe-web root, ufundeke kuphela yiseva yewebhu nomsebenzisi we-poller, kudayirekthri okungu-root nalowo msebenzisi kuphela abangabhala kuyo (okufanayo kuyasebenza nakumafayela obufakazi bokungena); i-plugin ayikaze iwudale noma iwubhale. Wenzele ikhophi yokusekelayo kanye nesizindalwazi: ngaphandle kwawo, ubufakazi bokungena obugcinwe kumele bufakwe futhi."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential File Directory"
msgstr "Idayirekthri Yamafayela Obufakazi Bokungena"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the directory that holds credential files. An account can read its credential from a file only inside it, never the vault key file. Empty, the default, refuses credential files. Cloud Admin chooses the file, so keep only cloud credentials here."
msgstr "Indlela ephelele eya kudayirekthri egcina amafayela obufakazi bokungena. I-akhawunti ingafunda ubufakazi bayo bokungena efayeleni elingaphakathi kuyo kuphela, hhayi ifayela lokhiye wevolthi. Uma kungenalutho, okuyisilungiselelo esizenzakalelayo, yenqaba amafayela obufakazi bokungena. U-Cloud Admin ukhetha ifayela, ngakho-ke gcina ubufakazi bokungena be-Cloud kuphela lapha."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Isiqoqi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Isabelomali Sesikhathi Sesiqoqi"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new work. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished accounts resume on the next run."
msgstr "Amasekhondi ukusebenza okukodwa kwesiqoqi okungawasebenzisa ngaphambi kokuba kuyeke ukuqala umsebenzi omusha. Kugcineni kungaphansi kwesikhawu se-poller; ama-akhawunti angaqediwe aqhubeka ekusebenzeni okulandelayo."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Khipha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Gcina Amathebula E-plugin Uma Ukhipha"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its accounts, encrypted credentials, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Cloud resources are never touched either way."
msgstr "Uma kumakiwe, ukukhipha i-plugin kugcina ama-akhawunti ayo, ubufakazi bokungena obubethelwe, kanye ne-cache. Susa ukumaka ukuze ukukhipha kukususe. Izinsiza ze-Cloud azithintwa nakanye nganoma iyiphi indlela."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "Not verified yet."
msgstr "Akukaqinisekiswa okwamanje."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works and has the permissions this account needs."
msgstr "Ubufakazi bokungena buyasebenza futhi bunazo izimvume ezidingwa yile akhawunti."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider rejected the credential. It may be wrong, expired, or revoked."
msgstr "Umhlinzeki wenqabe ubufakazi bokungena. Kungase kube yiphutha, kuphelelwe yisikhathi, noma kuhoxisiwe."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works but lacks a permission this account needs."
msgstr "Ubufakazi bokungena buyasebenza kodwa buntula imvume edingwa yile akhawunti."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider could not be reached. Check the network path and outbound policy from the poller."
msgstr "Umhlinzeki akakwazanga ukufinyelelwa. Hlola indlela yenethiwekhi nenqubomgomo yokuphuma evela ku-poller."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider is throttling requests. Try again later."
msgstr "Umhlinzeki unciphisa izinga lezicelo. Zama futhi emuva kwesikhathi."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider sent a response the plugin could not read."
msgstr "Umhlinzeki uthumele impendulo i-plugin engakwazanga ukuyifunda."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The account or its credential is not configured correctly."
msgstr "I-akhawunti noma ubufakazi bayo bokungena abulungiselelwe ngendlela efanele."

